[[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a></p><p>Make sure that the ignition is off (STOP\nposition), then disconnect the negative battery terminal (refer\nto op. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           ).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and move the relay holder backet (1b) away\nfrom the battery drip tray.</p><p>2. Disconnect the flow meter electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236533\">K41</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the nuts (3a) and remove retaining plates  (3b).</p><p>4. Remove flow meter (4a) together with the sleeve from the flow\nmeter to turbocharger air intake pipe (4b) and the sleeve from the\nfilter to flow meter (4c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2015135.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[576,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the flow meter and sleeves, then secure\nusing the nuts and plates.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nflow meter.</p><p>Place the relay holder bracket back in\nits housing and fix it using the bolts.</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a></p>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the air flow meter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236533\">K41</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the nuts (2a) and remove the mounting plates (2b).</p><p>3. Remove the air flow meter (3a), complete with hose (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069091.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[128,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the air flow meter in its seating\ncomplete with sleeve and secure it with the plates and nuts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nair flow meter.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238435\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the air flow meter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air flow meter</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236533\">K41</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the nuts (2a) and remove the mounting plates (2b).</p><p>3. Remove the air flow meter (3a), complete with hose (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069520.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the air flow meter in its seating\ncomplete with sleeve and secure it with the plates and nuts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nair flow meter.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237784\">1048A50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238429\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237758\">1016A10</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]